<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>mitmproxy - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/mitmproxy/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/mitmproxy/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>如何优雅地一键实现 macOS 网络代理切换</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/switch-macOS-web-proxy-in-elegant-way/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Nov 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/switch-macOS-web-proxy-in-elegant-way/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;code&gt;macOS&lt;/code&gt;中配置Web代理时，通常的做法是在控制面板中进行操作，&lt;code&gt;System Preferences&lt;/code&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;Network&lt;/code&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;Advanced&lt;/code&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;Proxies&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="lightgallery" target="_blank" href="https://debugtalk.com/image/macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting.jpg" title="macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting" data-thumbnail="/image/macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting.jpg" data-sub-html="&lt;h2&gt;macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting&lt;/h2&gt;"&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://debugtalk.com/image/macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting.jpg' alt="macOS-Web-Proxy-Setting"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;这种配置方式虽然可以实现需求，但缺点在于操作比较繁琐，特别是在需要频繁切换的情况下，效率极其低下。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>